{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "cam_rayleigh_friction",
  "description": "CAM6 Rayleigh friction (stage 2 of the EqESM project): the pointwise tendency law of rayleigh_friction.F90 (components/cam/src/atmos_phys/schemes/rayleigh_friction/rayleigh_friction.F90 of the instrumented cam6_4_212 fork) exactly as the SCAM dump window evaluates it. The profile: with raytau0 the damping timescale in days, otau0 = 1/(86400 raytau0), otau(k) = otau0 (1 + tanh((rayk0 - k)/krange))/2 for the level index k, where krange = raykrange, or (rayk0 - 1)/2 when raykrange = 0 (rayleigh_friction.F90:50-108, 113-126). The Euler-backward implicit update (F90:149-156): c2 = 1/(1 + otau ztodt), c1 = -otau c2, c3 = 0.5 (1 - c2^2)/ztodt, then dudt = c1 u, dvdt = c1 v, dsdt = c3 (u^2 + v^2) (the kinetic-energy dissipation heating). When raytau0 = 0 the run returns zero tendencies before touching the profile (F90:113-115); the model reproduces that branch with otau = 0 exactly (c2 = 1, c1 = c3 = 0). The dump window runs raytau0 = 0 (the rayleigh_friction_run call site tphysac, physpkg.F90:1730-1755, dumps site 16), so the dump pins exercise the zero branch; the enabled-branch pins (raytau0 = 1 day, rayk0 = 2, raykrange = 0 and 10) are compiled-Fortran references: the actual subroutines compiled verbatim from the fork with gfortran 11.5 in a driver (scratch/cam_laws_driver/driver.f90, mosart-precedent style) at the dump's step-1 u/v state, ztodt = 1800 s. Note the tanh saturation: with krange = 0.5 the argument (2 - k)/0.5 reaches -20 at k = 12 and tanh(-20) = -1 exactly in glibc, so otau and all tendencies are exactly 0 at k >= 12 even when enabled; krange = 10 is pinned to exercise nonzero damping of the O(1) winds. The esm blend c3 = 0.5 (1 - c2^2)/ztodt writes the division directly where the Fortran multiplies by rztodt = 1/ztodt (equal to 1 ulp); tanh is the system libm function (identical to gfortran's on this platform). Tests cite the cam_phys_tend.csv rows (site rayleigh) for the dump pins; all tendencies are dumped [m/s^2] (dudt, dvdt) and [J/kg/s] (dsdt)."
 },
 "models": {
  "RayleighFriction": {
   "variables": {
    "u": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/s",
     "default": 0.596798703981576,
     "description": "zonal wind at the level before the rayleigh update (state%u, rayleigh_friction.F90:146), [m/s]; dump column u of the site rayleigh rows"
    },
    "v": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/s",
     "default": -8.006150126686007,
     "description": "meridional wind before the rayleigh update (state%v), [m/s]; dump column v"
    },
    "ztodt": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "s",
     "default": 1800.0,
     "description": "physics timestep 2*dt of this SCAM run (physpkg.F90 ztodt), [s]"
    },
    "rayk0": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 2.0,
     "description": "center level of the damping profile, rayk0 (namelist integer; here dimensionless), [1]"
    },
    "raykrange": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "profile width, raykrange: 0 selects the default krange = (rayk0 - 1)/2 (rayleigh_friction.F90:89-92), [1]"
    },
    "raytau0": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "damping timescale in days, raytau0 (this run: 0, so the friction is disabled); 0 disables the scheme entirely (F90:113-115), [days]"
    },
    "k": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 16.0,
     "description": "level index k = 1..pver of the pointwise law (the profile is level-indexed: otau(k) = otau0 (1 + tanh((rayk0 - k)/krange))/2), [1]"
    },
    "krange": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "profile half-width, krange = raykrange, or (rayk0 - 1)/2 when raykrange = 0 (rayleigh_friction.F90:89-92), [1]"
    },
    "x": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "profile argument x = (rayk0 - k)/krange of the tanh (F90:124), [1]"
    },
    "otau": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1/s",
     "description": "damping rate profile otau(k) = otau0 (1 + tanh(x))/2, otau0 = 1/(86400 raytau0) (F90:123-126); 0 when raytau0 = 0 (the Fortran returns before computing it), [1/s]"
    },
    "c2": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "Euler-backward weight c2 = 1/(1 + otau ztodt) (F90:151), [1]"
    },
    "c1": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1/s",
     "description": "wind damping rate c1 = -otau c2 (F90:152), [1/s]"
    },
    "c3": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1/s",
     "description": "kinetic-energy dissipation rate c3 = 0.5 (1 - c2^2)/ztodt (F90:153), [1/s]"
    },
    "dudt": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s^2",
     "description": "zonal wind tendency dudt = c1 u (F90:154), [m/s^2]; dump column ptend_u"
    },
    "dvdt": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s^2",
     "description": "meridional wind tendency dvdt = c1 v (F90:155), [m/s^2]; dump column ptend_v"
    },
    "dsdt": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "J/(kg*s)",
     "description": "heating tendency dsdt = c3 (u^2 + v^2) (F90:156), the dissipated kinetic energy, [J/kg/s]; dump column ptend_s"
    }
   },
   "equations": [
    {
     "lhs": "krange",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "ifelse",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "==",
        "args": [
         "raykrange",
         {
          "op": "const",
          "args": [],
          "value": 0.0,
          "units": "1"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "/",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "-",
          "args": [
           "rayk0",
           {
            "op": "const",
            "args": [],
            "value": 1.0,
            "units": "1"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "const",
          "args": [],
          "value": 2.0,
          "units": "1"
         }
        ]
       },
       "raykrange"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "x",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "/",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "-",
        "args": [
         "rayk0",
         "k"
        ]
       },
       "krange"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "otau",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "ifelse",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "==",
        "args": [
         "raytau0",
         {
          "op": "const",
          "args": [],
          "value": 0.0,
          "units": "1"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "const",
        "args": [],
        "value": 0.0,
        "units": "1/s"
       },
       {
        "op": "/",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "*",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "const",
              "args": [],
              "value": 1.0,
              "units": "1"
             },
             {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
               {
                "op": "const",
                "args": [],
                "value": 86400.0,
                "units": "s"
               },
               "raytau0"
              ]
             }
            ]
           },
           {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "const",
              "args": [],
              "value": 1.0,
              "units": "1"
             },
             {
              "op": "tanh",
              "args": [
               "x"
              ]
             }
            ]
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "const",
          "args": [],
          "value": 2.0,
          "units": "1"
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "c2",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "/",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "const",
        "args": [],
        "value": 1.0,
        "units": "1"
       },
       {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "const",
          "args": [],
          "value": 1.0,
          "units": "1"
         },
         {
          "op": "*",
          "args": [
           "otau",
           "ztodt"
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "c1",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "-",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         "otau",
         "c2"
        ]
       }
      ]
